There should be two text boxes displayed side by side.

Left Text Box:

Contains the fields state_seller and city_seller.

Example value: Seattle, WA

Right Text Box:

Contains the field account_type_seller.

Example value: Dealer

In addition, there is a hidden system field:

Field: account_number_seller

Purpose: Acts as the relationship field to match each record with the corresponding Seller Account information.

This field should not be visible to the user.